    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89040" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσέλκω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw towards, draw on</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span> prob. l. in <i><span class="en">
